00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.900
If you have a question
about a difficult situation

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.360
that you maybe had in the past,

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.750
and you would like to have
my perspective on that,

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:55.830
let me know in the comments

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:57.370
and I'll try to give you an answer.

